@startuml P230_oid4vci_issue_pre_authorized_simple_ko

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' 설정
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
'=== Header and Footer ===
header OPEN-DID 기술 규격
footer
  	Page %page% of %lastpage% at %date("yyyy-MM-dd hh:mm:ss")
end footer

'=== 제목 ===
title
	<size:25>P230 : OID4VCI VC 발급 (Pre-Authorized Code)</size>
end title

'=== 옵션 ===
' 자동채번: ex) "<b>000." => 앞에 0을 채워 3자리 숫자로 표시
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"
' 페이지 하단 participant box 숨기기
'hide footbox

'=== Panticipants ===
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 500
skinparam MinClassWidth 80


actor USER

box 모바일 #OldLace
    participant "**월렛**" as WALLET <<Wallet>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box 발급 사업자 #AliceBlue
    participant "**발급 서비스**" as SERVICE <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**Credential Issuer**" as CI <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**Authorization Server**" as AS <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box 신뢰저장소
    participant "**blockchain**" as BC <<Storage>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' 상수
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

!$refdoc = "별도 문서 참조"
!$doc = "데이터명세 문서 참조"

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' 내용
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
|||

== P230-1 : Credential Offer 생성 ==
SERVICE -> CI++: Credential Offer 생성 요청
    rnote right of SERVICE #Lavender
        **[M230_REQ : Credential Offer 생성 요청]**
    end note
    CI -> AS++: Pre-Authorized Code 생성 요청
    return Pre-Authorized Code 생성 응답
    CI -> CI: Credential Offer 저장
return Credential Offer 생성 응답
rnote right of SERVICE #Lavender
    **[M230_RES : Credential Offer 생성 응답]**
end note
SERVICE -> USER: QR 코드 표시 및 tx_code(PIN) 안내

== P230-2 : Credential Offer 조회 ==
USER -> WALLET: QR 스캔
activate WALLET
WALLET -> CI++: Credential Offer 조회 요청
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M230_REQ : Credential Offer 조회 요청]**
    end note
    CI -> CI: Credential Offer 소비 (1회 조회)
return Credential Offer 조회 응답
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M230_RES : Credential Offer 조회 응답]**
end note

== P230-3 : Metadata 조회 ==
WALLET -> CI++: Credential Issuer Metadata 조회 요청
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M230_REQ : Credential Issuer Metadata 조회 요청]**
    end note
return Credential Issuer Metadata 조회 응답
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M230_RES : Credential Issuer Metadata 조회 응답]**
end note
WALLET -> AS++: Authorization Server Metadata 조회 요청
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M230_REQ : Authorization Server Metadata 조회 요청]**
    end note
return Authorization Server Metadata 조회 응답
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M230_RES : Authorization Server Metadata 조회 응답]**
end note

== P230-4 : Access Token 요청 ==
USER -[#Blue]\ WALLET: tx_code(PIN) 입력
WALLET -> AS++: Token 요청
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M230_REQ : Token 요청]**
    end note
    AS -> AS: Pre-Authorized Code 확인 및 access_token 생성
    opt authorization_details 요청 시
        AS -> CI++: Credential Identifier 조회 요청
        return Credential Identifier 조회 응답
    end
return Token 응답
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M230_RES : Token 응답]**
end note

== P230-5 : c_nonce 요청 ==
WALLET -> CI++: c_nonce 요청
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M230_REQ : c_nonce 요청]**
    end note
    CI -> CI: c_nonce 생성
return c_nonce 응답
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M230_RES : c_nonce 응답]**
end note

== P230-6 : Credential 요청 ==
WALLET -> WALLET: Proof JWT 생성
USER -[#Blue]\ WALLET: 사용자 인증(비표준)
WALLET -> WALLET: Holder DID 키로 Proof 서명
WALLET -> CI++: Credential 요청
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M230_REQ : Credential 요청]**
    end note
    CI <-> BC: Holder DID Document 조회
    CI -> CI: Proof 검증
    CI -> CI: Status List index 할당 및 Credential 생성
return Credential 응답
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M230_RES : Credential 응답]**
end note
WALLET <-> BC: Issuer DID Document 조회
WALLET -> WALLET: Credential 검증 및 저장
deactivate WALLET

@enduml
